title: HL-RCS — Register an Account
---
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor U as Guest
participant UI as «user interaction» AuthPage / AuthContext
participant C as «control» AuthController
participant S as «service» AuthServiceImpl
participant O as «service» RegistrationOtpService
participant R as «entity» OTP / User Repositories
participant J as «security» PasswordEncoder / JwtTokenProvider
Note over U,O: Precondition: contact verified through Registration Contact Verification
U->>UI: Submit name, email OR phone, password and confirmation
UI->>UI: Validate fields, matching passwords, agreement and token expiry
UI->>+C: POST /api/auth/register (RegisterRequest)
Note right of C: Invalid request fields return HTTP 400 before service call
C->>+S: register(request)
S->>S: Validate one contact, normalize; password at most 72 bytes
S->>+O: consume(contact, verificationToken)
O->>+R: findLocked(contact key)
R-->>-O: Verification challenge
alt Invalid, unverified or expired token
O-->>S: FieldValidationException
else Valid token
O->>+R: requireAvailable(contact): check existing accounts
R-->>-O: Availability result
O->>O: Reject used contact or clear token secret
O-->>S: Consumed or conflict exception
end
deactivate O
alt Validation or contact conflict
S-->>C: Exception; rollback registration transaction
C-->>UI: HTTP 400 / 409 — error
UI-->>U: Display validation or conflict error
else Verification consumed successfully
S->>+J: encode(password)
J-->>-S: Password hash
S->>+R: saveAndFlush(User: USER, ACTIVE, LOCAL)
R-->>-S: Saved user or uniqueness violation
alt Concurrent duplicate account
S-->>C: AppException (409); rollback including token consumption
C-->>UI: HTTP 409 — contact already used
UI-->>U: Display conflict
else Account saved
S->>+J: generateTokenFromUser(savedUser)
J-->>-S: JWT access token
S-->>C: AuthResponse; transaction commits
C-->>UI: HTTP 201 — ApiResponse of AuthResponse
UI->>UI: acceptSession(data, false); save JWT; set user
UI-->>U: Enter application as signed-in user
end
end
deactivate S
deactivate C
